Steve Fortescue 在 sparc64/sun4c 内存管理与 SunMMU 文档缺失（Tom Callaway 自述未修改任何基于 Solaris/OpenSolaris 源码的 Linux 代码）讨论中，通过 Peter Oberparleiter 的转发明确 OpenSolaris 授权边界：「Looking at the open solaris source could raise some legal concerns, because of the license it is under」+「OpenSolaris is mostly covered by the CDDL, which is incompatible with the GPL」+「the old solaris has never been released, as far as I know」；CDDL 系 Sun 借鉴 BSD-style 宽松许可（BSD/ISC/MIT 同族）设计的许可证，GPL/CDDL 兼容性争议本质是 BSD 系宽松许可家族与 GPL 副本主义的历史张力。此为 Sun/Solaris/CDDL 与 Linux/GPL 及 BSD 许可家族之间三方边界的讨论史料。

