Alan Cox 在 scsi_dh 导出符号变更补丁讨论中明确表达："That I doubt somehow. The GPL covers *all* derivative works. EXPORT_SYMBOL doesn't magically make code non-derivative. If you need to modify the kernel to make your driver work *and* you want to claim it is not derivative then I hope there are good lawyers involved 8-) ... The kernel is GPL, all derived works of a GPL codebase are required to be GPL. There is no magic rule about modules."。Mike Snitzer 则称 cc 给 LKML 是失误、GPL 狂热者过度解读，并反驳说这不是给专有驱动增加 Linux 功能的问题，而是 Linux 的 scsi_dh* 新增了会与长期存在的竞争专有驱动（如 EMC PowerPath）相冲突的 SCSI sense 处理，因此要在优先 Linux 自身 multipathing 的同时暴露一个让 Linux 不必妥协的接口。此为 GPL copyleft 边界在内核 SCSI 驱动接口层的直接讨论。

以上为邮件列表当事人一手自述/主张，属过程性证据，具体技术结论仍须以源码与提交记录复核为准，不得单独引为定论。【linux邮件提取】

