Theodore Ts'o 与 Jeremy Allison 就 GPLv2 强制的权力归属辩论。引文: "how about "Linus as the benevolent dictator"?  He makes a point of gathering input from multiple stakeholders, and delegating authority" 这是 Linux 与 BSD 版权许可哲学分立的治理标本, SFC 强制机制与 BSD 松散版权实践形成制度对照。

